      "general": {
        "abstract": "Sesoko Island is located at the west of northern part of Okinawa Island, Okinawa Prefecture, Japan.  Okinawa Prefecture is in subtropical climate, and islands of Okinawa are fringed by coral reefs.  Sesoko Island is a good field for studying coral reefs.",
